spans.s:
ए॑क a. one of (gen, abl., or —˚);
 alone, sole, single,
solitary;
 the same, identical, common (esp. ˚—);
 in l. l. a certain or
= the indef. article;
 with न and mostly w. चन or अपि no one,
none;
 pl. एके some. — एके—एके (अपरे, अन्ये) some — some (others).

एककाल a. occurring at the same time;
 abstr. ˚ता f.,
˚त्व n.

एकखुर a. one-hoofed, i.e. whole-hoofed;
 m. such an
animal.

एकग्राम m. the same village;
 ˚ग्रामीण a. dwelling in
the same village.

एकदेश m. a certain place or spot, one and the same
place;
 a part or portion of a whole, something individual.

ए॑कपत्नी f. the wife of one man, a faithful wife;
 pl.
having one and the same man.

1 एकपद n. one and the same spot;
 one (and the same)
word. — एकप˚दम् & एकप˚दे on the spot, at once, suddenly.

2 ए॑कपद a. measuring only one step;
 having one foot;
consisting of one word.

एकप्रहारिक a. getting (only) one blow;
 ˚कं कृ
kill with one blow.*

ए॑कमुख a. having one mouth, head, or chief;
 having the
same aim.

2 एकरस a. having only one inclination;
 finding pleasure
only in (—˚).

एकरा॑ज् m. single king, monarch;
 f. एकराज्ञी॑ single
queen.

एकराज॑ m. single king, monarch;
 f. एकराज्ञी॑ single
queen.

एकरात्र॑ m. a ceremony lasting one night;
 n. a night's
(day's) duration.

एकवेणि or एकवे˚णी f. a single braid of hair (as a sign
of mourning);
 ˚णीधरा f. wearing such a one.

1 एकवे˚णी f. a single braid of hair (as a sign of
mourning);
 ˚णीधरा f. wearing such a one.

ए॑कशफ a. one i.e. whole-hoofed. m. a whole-hoofed
animal;
 n. the solidungulous class of animals.

एकशेष m. the only rest, only left of (—˚);
 a kind of
ellipsis (g.).

ए॑कहायन f. ई one year old;
 f. a heifer one year
old.

एकातपत्र a. being under one umbrella (cf.
आतपत्र);
 w. प्रभुत्व n. universal sovereignty.

2 एकात्मन् a. reduced to one's self, solitary;
 of the same
essence as (gen.), abstr. ˚त्मता f.

एकादशि॑न् a. consisting of eleven;
 f. ˚शि॑नी the number
eleven.

1 एकायन॑ n. a path passable for only one;
 meeting-place;
absolute oneness.

2 एकार्थ a. having the same object or meaning;
 abstr.
˚ता f., ˚त्व n.
